    ["(8) Set: Casting Death Coil within 3 seconds after casting Life Tap will cause your Death Coil to deal 100% increased damage, but cannot critically hit and will not horrify."] = "(8) 套装：施放生命分流后 3 秒内施放死亡缠绕，会使你的死亡缠绕造成的伤害提高 100%，但无法爆击，也不会造成惊骇。",
    ["(8) Set: Casting Power Word: Shield when you are not in combat makes the absorption effect 40% stronger."] = "(8) 套装：非战斗状态下施放真言术：盾时，吸收效果提高 40%。",
    ["(8) Set: Causing damage to an enemy with or taking damage from Shadow Word: Death now gives your Mind Blast a 12% increased chance to critically strike. Lasts 8 sec. Stacks up to 2 times."] = "(8) 套装：使用暗言术：死亡对敌人造成伤害或受到暗言术：死亡伤害后，你的心灵震爆暴击几率提高 12%。持续8秒。最多可叠加 2 次。",
