    ["(8) Set: Each time Moonfire deals periodic damage, your next Starfire costs 5% less mana and casts 0.1 seconds faster, stacking up to 20 times."] = "(8) 套装：每当月火术造成周期性伤害时，你的下一次星火术法力消耗降低 5%，施法速度加快 0.1 秒，最多叠加 20 次。",
    ["(8) Set: Hitting an enemy with Mortal Strike reduces the cooldown of Bladestorm by 4 seconds.nReduces the Rage cost of Whirlwind by 3."] = "(8) 套装：用致死打击命中敌人会使剑刃风暴的冷却时间缩短 4 秒。旋风斩的怒气消耗降低 3 点。",
    ["(8) Set: Increases your spell damage by 1 for every 150 armor you have."] = "(8) 套装：你每拥有 150 点护甲，法术伤害提高 1 点。",
