    ["(8) Set: Steady Shot increases the damage dealt by your next Serpent Sting by 3%, stacking up to 10 times."] = "(8) 套装：稳固射击使你的下一次毒蛇钉刺造成的伤害提高 3%，最多叠加 10 次。",
    ["(8) Set: Swipe generates an additional 85 threat on each target it hits.nIncreases your maximum energy by 20 in Cat Form."] = "(8) 套装：横扫对每个命中的目标额外产生 85 点威胁值。在猎豹形态下，能量上限提高 20 点。",
    ["(8) Set: The first time Avenger's Shield deals damage, it now grants you an absorption effect equal to 200% of the damage dealt."] = "(8) 套装：复仇者之盾第一次造成伤害时，现在会为你提供相当于所造成伤害 200% 的吸收效果。",
    ["(8) Set: Thunder Clap generates 20% more threat."] = "(8) 套装：雷霆一击产生的威胁值提高 20%。",
