    ["Use: Absorbs 650 to 950 damage and makes you immune to Stun and Fear effects while the absorb holds. Lasts 10 sec. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 吸收 650 到 950 点伤害，并使你在吸收持续期间免疫眩晕和恐惧效果。持续10秒。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
