    ["Use: Absurdly spicy goblin stew of no nutritional value. Occasionally belch rank goblin breath for the next 5 min."] = "用途： 极其辛辣的妖精炖菜，毫无营养价值。在接下来的 5 分钟内偶尔会发出妖精般的呼吸声。",
    ["Use: Activate a Blue Sigil."] = "使用: 激活蓝色印记。",
