    ["Use: Allows opening of simple locks. The skeleton key is consumed in the process."] = "用途： 允许打开简单的锁。万能钥匙在此过程中被消耗。",
    ["Use: Allows opening of standard locks. The skeleton key is consumed in the process."] = "用途： 允许打开标准锁。万能钥匙在此过程中被消耗。",
    ["Use: Allows the Imbiber to breathe water for 1 hour."] = "使用：使饮用者可以在水下呼吸，持续 1小时。",
    ["Use: Allows the Imbiber to breathe water for 30 min."] = "使用：使饮用者可以在水下呼吸，持续 30分钟。",
    ["Use: Allows the shaman to see elemental spirits."] = "使用：使萨满祭司能够看见元素之灵。",
