    ["Use: Applies a blessing of Elune to the target weapon, increasing attack power by 15 and spell power by 10. Lasts for 30 Minutes. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：为目标武器施加艾露恩的祝福，使攻击强度提高 15 点、法术强度提高 10 点。持续 30分钟。（1秒冷却）",
