    ["Use: Attaches a Thorium Spike to your shield that deals damage every time you block with it."] = "使用: 在你的盾牌上安装一个瑟银尖刺，每次你用它格挡时都会造成伤害。",
    ["Use: Attaches a chain to your weapon, making it impossible to disarm."] = "使用: 在你的武器上系上一条锁链，使其无法解除武装。",
    ["Use: Attaches a counterweight to a two-handed sword, mace, axe or polearm making it 3% faster."] = "使用: 在双手剑、狼牙棒、斧头或长柄武器上安装一个配重，使其速度提高 3%。",
    ["Use: Attaches a permanent scope to a bow or gun that increases its damage by 1."] = "使用：为弓或枪械装上永久性瞄准镜，使其伤害提高 1 点。",
    ["Use: Attaches a permanent scope to a bow or gun that increases its damage by 2. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：为弓或枪械装上永久性瞄准镜，使其伤害提高 2 点。（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Attaches a permanent scope to a bow or gun that increases its damage by 3."] = "使用：为弓或枪械装上永久性瞄准镜，使其伤害提高 3 点。",
    ["Use: Attaches a permanent scope to a bow or gun that increases its damage by 5."] = "使用：为弓或枪械装上永久性瞄准镜，使其伤害提高 5 点。",
    ["Use: Attaches a permanent scope to a bow or gun that increases its damage by 7."] = "使用：为弓或枪械装上永久性瞄准镜，使其伤害提高 7 点。",
    ["Use: Attaches a permanent scope to a bow, crossbow, or gun that increases its chance to hit by 3%.nnAttaching this scope to a ranged weapon causes it to become soulbound."] = "使用：为弓或枪械装上永久性瞄准镜，使其命中几率提高 3%。将此瞄准镜装到远程武器上会使其变为灵魂绑定。",
    ["Use: Attaches an Iron Spike to your shield that deals damage every time you block with it."] = "使用: 在你的盾牌上安装一个铁钉，每次你用它格挡时都会造成伤害。",
    ["Use: Attaches spurs to your boots that increase your mounted movement speed slightly."] = "使用: 在你的靴子上安装马刺，稍微提高你的骑马移动速度。",
    ["Use: Attempt to capture a terrified animal. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：尝试捕获一只受惊的动物。（5秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Attempt to collect Cody the Cat."] = "使用: 尝试收集科迪猫。",
    ["Use: Attempt to extract a sediment core. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 尝试提取沉积物核心。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Attempt to fish up a mana tainted sludge from the Tower of Azora well. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 尝试从阿佐拉之塔井中打捞出被法力污染的污泥。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Attempt to fix the Broken Golem at the Thickbottom Farm. (0 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 尝试修复厚底农场的破损傀儡。 （0 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Attempt to lure the Vile Oozemother"] = "使用: 尝试引诱邪恶软泥母。",
    ["Use: Attempt to purify Bloodvenom Falls lake."] = "使用: 尝试净化血毒瀑布湖。",
    ["Use: Attempt to retrieve a sample from the Ruins of Stardust. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 尝试从星尘废墟中取回样本。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Attempts to remove 1 Curse, 1 Disease and 1 hostile Magic effect from the Imbiber. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 尝试从吸食者身上移除 1 个诅咒、1 个疾病和 1 个敌对魔法效果。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Attune the crystal upon the Highborne Spirit. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 调整上层精灵灵魂的水晶。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Attune to a crystal pile in northeast Silithus. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 调谐希利苏斯东北部的水晶堆。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Awaken the sleeping druid. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 唤醒沉睡的德鲁伊。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Banishes a Burning Exile (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：放逐一名烈焰流放者。（10秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Banishes a Cresting Exile (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：放逐一名水浪流放者。（10秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Banishes a Thundering Exile (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：放逐一名雷霆流放者。（10秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Base and instructions for upgrading a Dark Iron Pick, it says you will need 20 Dark Iron Bars and 4 Arcanite Bars to build a housing and channeling vein for a Burning Essence. Smithing not required, however a Black Forge is."] = "使用：升级黑铁镐的底座和说明。上面写着你需要 20 块黑铁锭和 4 块奥金锭，为燃烧精华制作外壳和导流脉络。不需要锻造技能，但需要黑熔炉。",
    ["Use: Begin winding up the cannon, building up 42 damage per second, up to 252 damage. When you move or stop winding you release the cannon ball, dealing its damage to all targets in front of you, with the damage split evenly. (3 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 开始上紧大炮，每秒造成 42 点伤害，最高可达 252 点伤害。当你移动或停止缠绕时，你会释放炮弹，对你面前的所有目标造成伤害，伤害平均分配。 （3 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Begins taming a Dire Mottled Boar to be your companion for 10 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 10 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
    ["Use: Begins taming a Greater Duskbat to be your companion for 15 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 15 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
