    ["Use: Begins taming a Surf Crawler to be your companion for 10 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 10 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
    ["Use: Begins taming a Vicious Night Web Spider to be your companion for 15 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 15 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
    ["Use: Begins taming a Webwood Lurker to be your companion for 10 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 10 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
    ["Use: Begins taming a Young Forest Bear to be your companion for 15 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 15 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
    ["Use: Begins taming an Armored Scorpid to be your companion for 10 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 10 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
    ["Use: Begins taming an Ice Claw Bear to be your companion for 10 minutes. If you lose the beast's attention for any reason, the taming process will fail."] = "使用：开始驯服一只野兽作为你的伙伴，持续 10 分钟。如果你因任何原因失去野兽的注意，驯服过程就会失败。",
    ["Use: Bind pages 1-4 into Chapter 1 of the Shredder Operating Manual."] = "使用：将第 1-4 页装订成《伐木机操作手册》第 1 章。",
    ["Use: Bind pages 5-8 into Chapter 2 of the Shredder Operating Manual."] = "使用：将第 5-8 页装订成《伐木机操作手册》第 2 章。",
    ["Use: Bind pages 9-12 into Chapter 3 of the Shredder Operating Manual."] = "使用：将第 9-12 页装订成《伐木机操作手册》第 3 章。",
    ["Use: Blast a Steam Vent with Rushing Waters to crumble it. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 用急流喷射蒸汽口，将其粉碎。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blasts enemies in front of you with the power of wind, fire, all that kind of thing! (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：用风、火等各种力量轰炸你面前的敌人！ （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blasts open difficult locked doors. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 炸开难以上锁的门。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blasts open nearly any locked door. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 炸开几乎所有上锁的门。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blasts open simple locked doors. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 炸开简单上锁的门。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blessing from the Holy Spring of Stranglethorn Vale. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 来自荆棘谷圣泉的祝福。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blow near Echeyakee's Lair. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在埃奇亚基的巢穴附近吹气。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blow on the whistle to let Fizzule know you're an ally."] = "使用: 吹哨子让菲祖尔知道你是盟友。",
    ["Use: Blow the horn at the gallows of Durnholde Keep to summon the Ghost of Blackmoore."] = "使用: 在敦霍尔德要塞的绞刑架上吹响号角来召唤布莱克摩尔的幽灵。",
    ["Use: Blow to summon Fireplume at Aerie Peak. (45 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在鹰巢山吹气召唤火羽。 （45 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Blow to summon Fireplume at his roost. (45 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 吹气将火羽召唤到他的栖息处。 （45 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Burn a nearby Pile of Meat in Hive'Zora."] = "使用: 烧毁佐拉巢穴附近的一堆肉。",
    ["Use: Burn a nearby Venture Co. Supply Crate in Windshear Crag."] = "使用: 烧毁风切岩附近的风险投资公司补给箱。",
    ["Use: Burn the Syndicate Food Supplies in Durnholde Keep."] = "使用: 烧掉敦霍尔德要塞的辛迪加食品补给品。",
    ["Use: Burns a nearby Frostmane Armaments box in Rik'watha."] = "使用: 烧掉附近瑞克瓦萨的一个霜鬃武器箱。",
    ["Use: Bury Bhondur's Bones at the Thelsamar Graveyard."] = "使用: 将邦杜尔的骨头埋在塞尔萨玛墓地。",
    ["Use: Bury at Marla's Grave."] = "使用: 埋葬在玛拉的坟墓中。",
    ["Use: Bury the watch at Joseph's grave."] = "使用: 将手表埋在约瑟夫的坟墓里。",
    ["Use: Call forth a felhunter using the summoning circle. (3 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 使用召唤法阵召唤地狱猎手。 （3 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Call forth a succubus using the summoning circle. (3 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 使用召唤法阵召唤魅魔。 （3 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Call forth a terrible force, binding it to an elemental form. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤一股可怕的力量，将其束缚在元素形态上。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Call forth a voidwalker using the summoning circle. (3 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 使用召唤法阵召唤虚空行者。 （3 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Call on the power of Elune and morph into a Moonkin. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤艾露恩的力量并变身为枭兽。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Calls down a pillar of fire, burning all enemies within the area for 52 to 68 Fire damage and an additional 48 Fire damage over 8 sec."] = "使用：召下一道火柱，灼烧区域内所有敌人，造成 52 到 68 点火焰伤害，并在 8秒 内额外造成 48 点火焰伤害。",
    ["Use: Calls forth 3 Silithid that will fight for you. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤 3 只异种蝎为你而战。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Calls forth 3 servants of the House Barov that will fight, cook, and clean for you. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤 3 名巴罗夫家族的仆人，为你战斗、做饭和打扫卫生。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Calls forth a Timbermaw Ancestor to fight at your side and heal you. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤木喉祖先与你并肩作战并治疗你。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Captures a mounted player target up to 35 yards away in a net for 5 sec. Requires Warmode. Only usable within the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. (15 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 用网捕捉 35 码外的骑乘玩家目标，持续 5 秒。需要战争模式。只能在东部王国和卡利姆多使用。 （15 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Captures radioactive fallout."] = "用途：捕获放射性尘埃。",
    ["Use: Captures the spirit of a Felhound to be used in the creation of a warlockian orb."] = "使用: 捕获地狱犬的灵魂并用于制造术士宝珠。",
    ["Use: Captures the spirit of the nearest Burning Blade member. If target dies while being drained, the caster gains 1 Infused Burning Gem."] = "使用: 捕获最近的火刃成员的灵魂。如果目标在被吸取时死亡，施法者将获得 1 颗注入燃烧宝石。",
    ["Use: Captures the target in a net for 20 sec. The net has a lot of hooks however and sometimes gets caught in the user's clothing when fired...... (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将目标捕获在网中，持续 20 秒。然而，网有很多钩子，有时在发射时会被使用者的衣服钩住……（10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Casts your Summon Voidwalker spell with no mana or Soul Shard requirements. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 施展召唤虚空行者法术，无需法力或灵魂碎片。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Causes all Beasts in a 5 yard radius to run away for 10 sec."] = "使用: 使 5 码半径内的所有野兽逃跑 10 秒。",
    ["Use: Causes death at some point within the next day."] = "使用：在第二天的某个时刻导致死亡。",
    ["Use: Causes nearby players to dance. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 使附近的玩家跳舞。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Change the school of magic that this wand fires."] = "使用：改变这根魔杖发射的魔法学派。",
    ["Use: Change yourself into something more befitting the wintry season. Requires a Snowball to use."] = "使用: 将自己打扮得更适合冬季。需要雪球才能使用。",
    ["Use: Changes the appearance of your bear and dire bear forms to that of a primal bear of olde."] = "使用: 将你的熊和凶暴熊形态的外观改变为远古熊的外观。",
    ["Use: Changes the appearance of your bear, dire bear, and cat forms to that of primal appearances of olde."] = "使用: 将你的熊、凶暴熊和猫形态的外观改变为古老的原始外观。",
    ["Use: Changes the appearance of your cat form to that of a primal cat of olde."] = "使用: 将你的猫形态的外观改变为古老的原始猫形态。",
    ["Use: Channel into the skull of the blue dragon in Azure Rest to drag his spirit out of the nether."] = "使用: 引导进入蔚蓝之眠中蓝龙的头骨，将他的灵魂拖出虚空。",
    ["Use: Channels 75 health into mana every 1 sec for 10 sec. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 每 1 秒将 75 点生命值转化为法力，持续 10 秒。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Channels a bolt of lightning and hurls it towards all enemies in front of the caster causing 147 to 167 Nature damage. The caster is then surrounded by a barrier of electricity for 10 min. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 引导一道闪电并将其投向施法者前方的所有敌人，造成 147 到 167 点自然伤害。然后施法者被电屏障包围 10 分钟。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Charge an enemy, knocking it silly for 30 seconds. Also knocks you down, stunning you for a short period of time. Any damage caused will revive the target. (20 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 向敌人冲锋，将其击晕 30 秒。也会击倒你，让你在短时间内震惊。造成的任何伤害都会使目标复活。 （20 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Charge an enemy, knocking it silly for 30 seconds. Also knocks you down, stunning you for a short period of time. Any damage caused will revive the target. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 向敌人冲锋，将其击晕 30 秒。也会击倒你，让你在短时间内震惊。造成的任何伤害都会使目标复活。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Charge the battery on Raging Tempests in Tanaris. Only usable at low health."] = "使用: 在塔纳利斯的狂暴风暴上给电池充电。仅在生命值较低时可用。",
    ["Use: Charge the core at the Altar of Storms west of Blackrock Mountain."] = "使用: 在黑石山以西的风暴祭坛充能核心。",
    ["Use: Charge with the power of An'she during the day at the Earthmother's Shrine in the Barrens."] = "使用: 白天在贫瘠之地的大地母神殿中使用安舍的力量进行充电。",
    ["Use: Charge with the power of Mu'sha at night at the Earthmother's Shrine in Stonetalon Mountains."] = "使用: 晚上在石爪山脉的大地母神殿中注入穆莎的力量。",
    ["Use: Charges the Rod of Helcular when used at the three ceremonial pyres."] = "使用: 在三个仪式柴堆上使用时，为赫尔库拉之杖充能。",
    ["Use: Claim the promised soul."] = "使用: 领取约定的灵魂。",
    ["Use: Clean up a Tanaris Oil Spill. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 清理塔纳利斯的漏油事件。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Clean up a Venture Co. Oil Spill. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：清理风险投资公司的漏油事件。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Cleans the targeted Oil-Coated Critter. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：清洁目标沾有油污的小动物。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Cleans the targeted Stormpike, Dun Morogh, or Mounted Ironforge Mountaineer's gun. Only usable if the target has not had their gun cleaned recently. (2 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 清洁目标雷矛、丹莫罗或铁炉堡登山者的枪。仅当目标最近没有清洁过枪时才可用。 （2 秒冷却时间）",
