    ["Use: Coats a weapon with poison that lasts for 1 hour.nEach strike has a 30% chance of poisoning the enemy, causing 38 Nature damage and reducing all healing effects used on them by 10% for 15 sec. Stacks up to 5 times on a single target."] = "使用：给武器涂毒，持续 1小时。每次攻击有 30% 几率使敌人中毒，造成 38 点自然伤害，并使其受到的所有治疗效果降低 10%，持续 15秒。同一目标最多叠加 5 次。",
    ["Use: Coats a weapon with poison that lasts for 1 hour.nEach strike has a 30% chance of poisoning the enemy, causing 53 Nature damage and reducing all healing effects used on them by 10% for 15 sec. Stacks up to 5 times on a single target."] = "使用：给武器涂毒，持续 1小时。每次攻击有 30% 几率使敌人中毒，造成 53 点自然伤害，并使其受到的所有治疗效果降低 10%，持续 15秒。同一目标最多叠加 5 次。",
    ["Use: Coats a weapon with poison that lasts for 1 hour.nEach strike has a 30% chance of poisoning the enemy, slowing their movement speed by 50% for 12 sec."] = "使用：给武器涂毒，持续 1小时。每次攻击有 30% 几率使敌人中毒，使其移动速度降低 50%，持续 12秒。",
    ["Use: Coats a weapon with poison that lasts for 1 hour.nEach strike has a 30% chance of poisoning the enemy, slowing their movement speed by 70% for 12 sec."] = "使用：给武器涂毒，持续 1小时。每次攻击有 30% 几率使敌人中毒，使其移动速度降低 70%，持续 12秒。",
    ["Use: Coats a weapon with poison that lasts for 1.50 hrs.nEach strike has a 40% chance of poisoning the enemy for 96 Nature damage over 12 sec. Stacks up to 5 times on a single target."] = "使用：给武器涂毒，持续 1.5小时。每次攻击有 40% 几率使敌人中毒，在 12秒 内造成 96 点自然伤害。同一目标最多叠加 5 次。",
    ["Use: Collapses the flow of magic into itself, rendering the target silent."] = "使用: 将魔法流压缩成自身，使目标沉默。",
    ["Use: Collect a nearby frozen dragon egg. (6 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 收集附近的一个冰冻龙蛋。 （6 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Combine 4 Grimtotem Notes into the Grimtotem Battle Plan."] = "使用: 将 4 个恐怖图腾笔记合并到恐怖图腾作战计划中。",
    ["Use: Combine 7 pieces of Living Rot inside the mortar and grind away with the pestle. Leave standing to allow coagulation."] = "使用：将 7 块活腐菌放入研钵中，用杵研磨。静置以使其凝固。",
    ["Use: Combine Dragonmaw Pants, Tunic, and Skin to create a Crude Dragonmaw Outfit."] = "使用: 将龙喉长裤、外衣和皮肤组合成一套粗制的龙喉服装。",
    ["Use: Combine the Ace through Eight of Beasts to complete the set."] = "使用：将野兽套牌的一到八号牌合成为完整套牌。",
    ["Use: Combine the Ace through Eight of Elementals to complete the set."] = "使用：将元素套牌的一到八号牌合成为完整套牌。",
    ["Use: Combine the Ace through Eight of Portals to complete the set."] = "使用：将入口套牌的一到八号牌合成为完整套牌。",
    ["Use: Combine the Ace through Eight of Warlords to complete the set."] = "使用：将督军套牌的一到八号牌合成为完整套牌。",
    ["Use: Combine the Good Luck Half-Charm with the Good Luck Other-Half-Charm."] = "使用: 将一半好运护身符与另一半好运护身符结合起来。",
    ["Use: Combine the Lower and Upper Twilight Tablets."] = "使用：将下层和上层暮光石板组合起来。",
    ["Use: Combine with 1 Dark Rune and 5 Elemental Air to create a Signet of Beckoning: Thunder."] = "使用: 与 1 个黑暗符文和 5 个元素之气结合，制造出召唤徽记：雷霆。",
    ["Use: Combine with the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance to form the Pendant of the Sea Lion."] = "使用: 与水中耐力半坠饰结合形成海狮坠饰。",
    ["Use: Combines Jang'thraze and Sang'thraze to form the mighty sword, Sul'thraze."] = "使用: 将张萨雷兹和桑萨雷兹结合起来形成强大的剑苏尔萨雷兹。",
    ["Use: Complete the aquatic time trial at the Shrine of Remulos."] = "使用: 在雷姆洛斯神殿完成水上计时赛。",
    ["Use: Concentrate the Trance Enhancer onto the Shadow Wraith, siphoning their essence. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将恍惚增强剂集中到暗影幽灵身上，吸取它们的精华。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Concentrate the orb's power onto the thunder lizard, siphoning their essence. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将球体的力量集中到雷霆蜥蜴身上，吸取它们的精华。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Concentrate the rod's power onto the kodo, siphoning their essence. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将魔杖的力量集中到科多兽身上，吸取它们的精华。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Conjures a Lily Root that restores health and mana when eaten. (1 Hr Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤出百合根，食用后可以恢复生命值和法力。 （1 小时冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Conjures food to eat. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：召唤食物来吃。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Consume 5 stacks of Raw Fury of the Black Flight to transform into a Black Drakonid, granting 100 strength for 20 sec. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 消耗 5 层黑色飞翔原始之怒以变身为黑色龙人，获得 100 点力量，持续 20 秒。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Consume two Un'Goro Soil samples and a Packet of Tharlendris seeds to make an Evergreen Herb Casing. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 消耗两个安戈洛土壤样本和一包萨兰德里斯种子来制作常绿药草外壳。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Controls Emberstrife's mind when his will falters."] = "使用: 当安博斯特莱夫的意志动摇时控制他的思想。",
    ["Use: Cool and calm a weakened Boiling Wanderer."] = "使用: 冷却并镇静虚弱的沸腾流浪者。",
    ["Use: Cools a weakened Raging Cinders elemental enough for their bindings to be collected."] = "使用: 将被削弱的狂怒灰烬元素冷却到足以收集其绑定物的程度。",
    ["Use: Counters the enemy's spellcast, preventing any spell from that school of magic from being cast for 10 sec. Generates a high amount of threat."] = "使用: 反击敌人的施法，阻止该魔法流派的任何法术施展，持续 10 秒。产生大量威胁。",
    ["Use: Create a containment coffer on a stunned Rift Spawn (8 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在昏迷的裂缝生成体上创建一个收容库（8秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Creates a Battle Chicken that will fight for you for 1.50 min or until it is destroyed. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 创建一只战斗鸡，它会为你战斗 1.50 分钟或直到它被摧毁。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Creates a Compact Harvest Reaper that will fight for you for 10 min or until it is destroyed. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 创建一个紧凑型收割机，它会为你战斗 10 分钟或直到它被摧毁。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Creates a Shredder Unit that you control!"] = "使用: 创建一个由你控制的粉碎机单位！",
    ["Use: Creates a bowl of purified food that the furbolg are sure to enjoy. It requires fruit, grain, and nuts from the Blackwood camp."] = "使用: 制作一碗熊怪一定会喜欢的纯净食物。它需要来自布莱克伍德营地的水果、谷物和坚果。",
    ["Use: Creates a bowl of scrying that will contact Talvash. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 制造一碗能够接触塔瓦什的占卜碗。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Creates a bowl of scrying. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 制造一碗占卜碗。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Creates a mobile bomb that charges the nearest enemy and explodes for 315 to 385 fire damage. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 制造一枚移动炸弹，向最近的敌人冲锋并爆炸，造成 315 到 385 点火焰伤害。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Creates a portal, teleporting group members that use it to Earth Song Falls in inner Maraudon. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 创建一个传送门，将使用它的小组成员传送到玛拉顿内部的大地之歌瀑布。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Cure a sickly animal afflicted by the taint of poison. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 治愈受毒害的病态动物。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Cure for the Touch of Zanzil."] = "使用：赞吉尔之触的解药。",
    ["Use: Cures 1 poison effect."] = "使用：解除 1 个毒药效果。",
    ["Use: Cures 2 diseases and neutralizes 2 poisons."] = "使用：治愈 2 个疾病效果，并中和 2 个毒药效果。",
    ["Use: Cures all diseases and neutralizes all poisons. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "用途：治愈一切疾病，解一切毒。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Cures up to 4 diseases. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "用途：治愈最多 4 种疾病。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Deals 125 Fire damage to all targets in a cone in front of the caster. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 对施法者前方锥形范围内的所有目标造成 125 点火焰伤害。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Deals 25 Fire damage every 5 sec to all nearby enemies for 15 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 每 5 秒对附近所有敌人造成 25 点火焰伤害，持续 15 秒。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Deals 50 Fire damage every 1 sec for 5 sec to all enemies in front of you. Gets you quite drunk too! (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：每 1 秒造成 50 点火焰伤害，持续 5 秒。",
    ["Use: Decrease the armor of target by 50 for 1 min. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 降低目标50点护甲值，持续1分钟。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Decrease the armor of the target by 50 for 30 sec. While affected, the target cannot stealth or turn invisible."] = "使用：使目标的护甲降低 50 点，持续 30秒。在效果持续期间，目标无法潜行或隐形。",
    ["Use: Decreases an enemy target's Armor by 200 for 2 min."] = "使用: 使敌方目标的护甲值降低 200 点，持续 2 分钟。",
    ["Use: Decreases target's chance to hit by 25% for 10 sec."] = "使用：使目标的命中几率降低 25%，持续 10秒。",
    ["Use: Demon Pick to Destroy Demon Crystal."] = "使用：恶魔镐来摧毁恶魔水晶。",
    ["Use: Destabilize weak elemental ice, freeing a captive villager. (6 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 破坏微弱的元素冰的稳定性，释放一名被俘虏的村民。 （6 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Destroy Chillbone's Phylactery in Blackrock Mountain. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 摧毁黑石山的冰骨护命匣。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Detonates NG-5 Charge (Blue) after it's been set."] = "使用：在安置后引爆五号炸药（蓝色）。",
    ["Use: Detonates NG-5 Charge (Red) after it's been set."] = "使用：在安置后引爆五号炸药（红色）。",
    ["Use: Digs up silithid eggs. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 挖出异种蜥蜴的蛋。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Dispels Blazerunner's Aura."] = "使用: 驱散开拓者的光环。",
    ["Use: Dispels Polymorph effects on a friendly target. Also restores 150 to 250 health and mana. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 消除友方目标上的变形效果。还可以恢复 150 到 250 点生命值和法力。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Dispels all harmful magic effects from the caster. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 驱散施法者身上所有有害的魔法效果。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Dispels all harmful magic effects from the caster. (4 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 驱散施法者身上所有有害的魔法效果。 （4 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Dispels all harmful magic effects from the caster. (6 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 驱散施法者身上所有有害的魔法效果。 （6 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Dispels the Balefire curse from a friendly target. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：驱散一个友方目标身上的灾火诅咒。（10秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Disrupt the summoning of infernal souls within the summoning chamber of the Deathforge."] = "使用: 扰乱死亡熔炉召唤室中地狱灵魂的召唤。",
    ["Use: Does 50 fire damage to any enemies within a 5 yard radius around the caster every 3 seconds for 15 sec"] = "使用：每 3秒 对施法者周围 5 码内的所有敌人造成 50 点火焰伤害，持续 15秒。",
    ["Use: Don't eat me."] = "使用: 别吃我。",
    ["Use: Douses the flames off the braziers found within Jaedenar and dispels their protective magic."] = "使用: 扑灭加德纳尔内火盆的火焰并驱散它们的防护魔法。",
    ["Use: Drains 675 to 1125 mana from those in the blast radius and does 50% of the mana drained in damage to the target. Also Silences targets in the blast for 5 sec."] = "使用: 从爆炸半径内吸取 675 到 1125 点法力，并对目标造成伤害，造成所吸取法力的 50%。还能使爆炸中的目标沉默 5 秒。",
    ["Use: Drains the targeted Phase Hunter of its energy. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 吸取目标相位猎手的能量。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Draw a sample of water from the pool of water at the top of Dreadmist Peak."] = "使用: 从鬼雾峰顶的水池中抽取水样。",
    ["Use: Draw a sample of water from the waterfall at the mouth of the Cliffspring Falls cave ."] = "使用: 从崖泉瀑布洞口的瀑布中抽取水样。",
    ["Use: Drink Me. (3 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 喝我。 （3 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Drink in the Tanaris Graveyard."] = "使用: 在塔纳利斯墓地喝酒。",
    ["Use: Drink the Theramore Red."] = "使用: 喝塞拉摩红酒。",
    ["Use: Drink up! (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：一饮而尽！（2分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Drive the spirit out of Spiritseer Nishelle. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将灵魂驱赶出灵魂先知尼谢尔。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Drops a target dummy on the ground that attracts nearby monsters to attack it. Lasts for 15 seconds or until killed."] = "使用: 将一个目标假人扔在地上，吸引附近的怪物攻击它。持续15秒或直到被杀死。",
    ["Use: Dummy Trigger"] = "用途：虚拟触发器。",
    ["Use: Eat me. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：吃掉我。（10秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Empower yourself with the Blessing of An'she for 1 minute. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 用安舍的祝福增强自己的力量，持续 1 分钟。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Enchants a weapon to have a 15% chance to inflict 9 to 13 Fire damage to all enemies within 3 yards. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 为武器附魔，有 15% 的几率对 3 码内的所有敌人造成 9 到 13 点火焰伤害。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Enchants the main hand weapon with fire, granting each attack a chance to deal 25 to 35 additional fire damage, and increasing your damage done by Fire spells and effects by up to 10"] = "使用: 为主手武器附魔火焰，使每次攻击有机会造成 25 到 35 点额外火焰伤害，并使你的火焰法术和效果造成的伤害最多提高 10 点。",
    ["Use: Energize at the Equinex Monolith."] = "使用：在伊奎尼克斯石碑处充能。",
    ["Use: Engage in mental combat with a humanoid target to try and control their mind. If all works well, you will control the mind of the target for 30 sec ..... (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 与人形目标进行精神战斗，试图控制他们的思想。如果一切顺利，你将控制目标的思想30秒......（30分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Engaging Tizzie's Jetpack (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：启用蒂兹的喷气背包（1秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Enlarges a critter to twice its normal size. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将小动物放大到正常大小的两倍。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
