    ["Use: Insulate the target's mind against mental incursions. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 隔离目标的心灵免受精神入侵。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Invokes Thunderhorn spirits of cleansing."] = "使用: 召唤雷角净化之灵。",
