    ["Use: Jumper Cables will sometimes be able to shock a dead player back to life. Cannot be used when in combat."] = "使用：起搏器有时能电击死亡的玩家，使其复活。战斗中无法使用。",
    ["Use: Killing a non-mechanical enemy restores your health, equivalent to 3% of that enemy's maximum health. Lasts 30 min."] = "使用: 杀死一个非机械敌人可以恢复你的生命值，相当于该敌人最大生命值的 3%。持续 30 分钟。",
    ["Use: Kills all enemies in a 30 yard radius. Cheater."] = "使用: 杀死 30 码半径内的所有敌人。骗子。",
    ["Use: Knock back all enemies within 8 yards. Requires Warmode. Only usable within the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 击退8码内的所有敌人。需要战争模式。只能在东部王国和卡利姆多使用。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Kodo Kombobulator on any Ancient, Aged, or Dying Kodo to lure the Kodo to follow (one at a time)."] = "使用：对任意古老、年迈或垂死的科多兽使用科多兽诱导器，引诱科多兽跟随你（一次一只）。",
    ["Use: Lay a set of Ogre Remains to rest in the Stonemaul Ruins. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将一组食人魔遗骸放置在石槌废墟中。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Lay the wreath at the Hyal Family Monument."] = "使用: 在海尔家族纪念碑前敬献花圈。",
    ["Use: Let the fog roll in. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 让雾气滚滚而来。（10秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Lets you walk on water for 30 min. Guardian Elixir."] = "使用：让你在水上行走 30 分钟。守护灵丹。",
    ["Use: Light the Unlit Torch at Kaela's Campfire."] = "使用: 在凯拉的篝火处点燃未点燃的火把。",
    ["Use: Light this torch at any fire."] = "使用: 在任何火上点燃此火把。",
    ["Use: Load with 5 Zulian Mudskunks, and then cast from Pagle's Point in Zul'Gurub. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 装载 5 只祖利安臭鼬，然后从祖尔格拉布的帕格角施放。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Look upon the sheen of thy blessed metal, restoring 280 health and granting 6 Spirit for 3 min. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 看看你受祝福的金属的光泽，恢复 280 点生命值并获得 6 点精神，持续 3 分钟。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Lures out the queen of the Gorishi hive when used on a Gorishi Silithid Crystal."] = "使用: 对戈里什异种水晶使用时，引诱戈里什蜂巢的女王。",
    ["Use: Makes you better able to think like a pirate. (3 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 使你能够更好地像海盗一样思考。 （3 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Makes you immune to Stun and Movement Impairing effects for the next 30 sec. Does not remove effects already on the imbiber. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 使你在接下来的 30 秒内免疫眩晕和移动阻碍效果。不会消除已经对饮用者产生的影响。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Makes you immune to Stun and Movement Impairing effects for the next 5 sec. Also removes existing Stun and Movement Impairing effects. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：使你免疫昏迷和移动限制效果，持续 5秒。同时移除已有的昏迷和移动限制效果。（2分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Makes you slightly tipsy and increases your skill in fishing by 10 for 3 min."] = "使用: 让你有点微醉，并提高你的钓鱼技能 10 点，持续 3 分钟。",
    ["Use: Mark your current overworld location for the next 4 hours using a Grombolar Soulstone. Use again to destroy the mark and recall yourself to its location. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：用格罗姆博拉灵魂石标记你当前的户外位置，持续 4 小时。再次使用会摧毁标记并将你召回到该位置。（10秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Mind Control Dennis the Silithid for 5 min. May only be used in Anje'Watha."] = "使用：精神控制异种虫丹尼斯，持续 5 分钟。只能在安杰瓦萨使用。",
