    ["Use: Permanently increase the armor value of an item worn on the chest, legs, hands or feet by 40. Only usable on items level 35 and above. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：永久性地使穿戴在胸部、腿部、手部或脚部的物品护甲值提高 40 点。只能用于等级 35 及以上的物品。（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Permanently increase the armor value of an item worn on the chest, legs, hands or feet by 8. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：永久性地使穿戴在胸部、腿部、手部或脚部的物品护甲值提高 8 点。（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Physical damage caused by the target is reduced by 5 for 2 min."] = "使用：目标造成的物理伤害减少 5 点，持续 2 分钟。",
    ["Use: Place Jack's Letter within Faye Underhill's home."] = "使用: 将杰克的信放在费耶安德希尔的家中。",
    ["Use: Place a Battle Standard with 1500 health that increases the maximum health of all party members that stay within 45 yards of the Battle Standard by 15%. Lasts 2 min. The Battle Standard may only be used in PvP Battlegrounds. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：放置一面拥有 1500 点生命值的战斗旌旗，使停留在旌旗 45 码范围内的所有小队成员生命值上限提高 15%。持续 2 分钟。战斗旌旗只能在玩家对战战场中使用。（10分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Place a Timed Explosive on the Tanaris Oil Rig. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在塔纳利斯石油钻井平台上放置定时炸药。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place a chest at the target area. When the chest is opened, players in a 5 yard radius will be feared for 3 seconds. Lasts 10 minutes. Not useable in instances and battlegrounds. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在目标区域放置一个箱子。当宝箱打开时，5码半径内的玩家将被恐惧3秒。持续10分钟。无法在实例和战场中使用。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place a dense stone statue on the ground where it will heal you for a short time before its power fades."] = "使用：在地面放置一座厚重石像，它会在力量消散前短暂治疗你。",
    ["Use: Place a flag on an enemy player's corpse in front of you. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在你面前的敌方玩家尸体上放置一面旗帜。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place a solid stone statue on the ground where it will heal you for a short time before its power fades."] = "使用：在地面放置一座坚固石像，它会在力量消散前短暂治疗你。",
    ["Use: Place an offering at the Altar of Gral."] = "使用: 在格鲁尔祭坛上放置祭品。",
    ["Use: Place at a Witherbark village."] = "使用：放置在枯木村中。",
    ["Use: Place at a scytheclaw nest. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 放置在镰爪巢穴中。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place at the Foulweald Totem Mound."] = "使用: 放置在恶沼图腾丘上。",
    ["Use: Place at the Stone of Shy-Rotam."] = "使用: 放置在希罗塔姆之石处。",
    ["Use: Place between the Dead Goliaths in the Valley of Bones. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 放置在骸骨谷中死去的歌利亚之间。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place down the Ice Core Extractor, which will need to be defended for 1.5 minutes! Must be placed in a deep area of the icy lake, south of the small island."] = "使用: 放下冰核提取器，需要防御1.5分钟！必须放置在小岛南面冰湖深处。",
    ["Use: Place in the Darrowshire Town Square."] = "使用: 放置在达隆郡城镇广场。",
    ["Use: Place in the Maraudine War Horn, and blow."] = "使用：放入玛洛迪战斗号角中并吹响。",
    ["Use: Place in the Talon Den."] = "使用: 放置在利爪巢穴中。",
    ["Use: Place in the Uldaman map room."] = "使用: 放置在奥达曼地图室中。",
    ["Use: Place in the doorway at one of Andorhal's ruined towers as a magical marker for future troop movement. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 放置在安多哈尔一座废弃塔楼的门口，作为未来部队调动的魔法标记。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place in the main chamber of Caer Darrow's keep to draw Duke Lionheart out."] = "使用: 放置在凯尔达隆要塞的主室中以引出狮心公爵。",
    ["Use: Place near Miblon Snarltooth."] = "使用: 放置在米布隆巨牙附近。",
    ["Use: Place near the Dead Tree northwest of Ratchet, to lure Ishamuhale."] = "使用: 放置在棘齿城西北部的死树附近，以引诱伊沙穆哈勒。",
    ["Use: Place near the Venture Co. Airport"] = "用途：放置在风险投资公司机场附近。",
    ["Use: Place near the well at the center of Aerie Peak. Show those filthy dwarven dogs your resolve! Then run away..."] = "使用: 放置在鹰巢山中心的井附近。向那些肮脏的矮人狗展示你的决心！然后逃走...。",
    ["Use: Place on a SOFT DIRT MOUND."] = "使用：放置在软土堆上。",
    ["Use: Place on one of the four corrupted spots in Azure Rest to prevent the azure blight from spreading. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 放置在蔚蓝休息区的四个腐化点之一上，以防止蔚蓝枯萎病蔓延。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place the Gaea seed into the Gaea dirt mound."] = "使用: 将盖亚种子放入盖亚土丘中。",
    ["Use: Place the Kodo Calf Bait at the entrance of the Bloodhoof Village Inn. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将科多兽小牛诱饵放置在血蹄村旅店的入口处。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place the Picnic Set within the Darkshire Hay Field. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将野餐套装放置在夜色郡干草场内。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place the Strong Smelling Bait within Fireplume's Roost. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将气味强烈的诱饵放入火羽的栖息处。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place the fungus sample into the prepared soil. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：将真菌样品放入准备好的土壤中。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place the soil sample into the prepared soil. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用方法：将土样放入准备好的土壤中。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Place upon the Altar of Fire"] = "使用: 放置在火焰祭坛上。",
    ["Use: Place upon the Flame of Uzel."] = "使用: 放置在乌泽尔之焰上。",
    ["Use: Place upon the Flat Un'Goro Rock."] = "使用: 放置在平坦的安戈洛岩石上。",
    ["Use: Place upon the Seaworn Altar, if you dare..."] = "使用: 放置在海蚀祭坛上，如果你敢的话……。",
    ["Use: Place within the Viewing Room of the Scholomance."] = "使用: 放置在通灵学院的观景室内。",
    ["Use: Places Ectoplasmic Distiller on the ground, allowing Ectoplasm to be gathered. Requires Goblin Rocket Fuel."] = "使用：将灵质蒸馏器放置在地面上，以收集灵质。需要妖精火箭燃料。",
    ["Use: Places a Land Mine on the ground. When a hostile creature passes near, It will explode for 394 to 506 fire damage and knock them away. The mine has a duration of 2 min."] = "使用：在地上放置一枚地雷。当敌对生物经过附近时，地雷会爆炸，造成 394 到 506 点火焰伤害并将其击退。地雷持续 2分钟。",
    ["Use: Places a bundle of bloodthistle at the end of the bridge."] = "使用: 将一捆血蓟放在桥的末端。",
    ["Use: Places all five of the Khans' gems in the Amulet of Spirits."] = "使用: 将可汗的所有五颗宝石放入灵魂护身符中。",
    ["Use: Places gem in Naga statue. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将宝石放置在娜迦雕像中。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
