    ["Use: Places the Unforged Seal of Ascension. Use in front of Emberstrife."] = "使用：放置未铸造的晋升印章。请在埃博斯塔夫面前使用。",
    ["Use: Plant the Captured Totem in the ground. Can only be used in the Quagmire. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将捕获的图腾种植在地里。只能在泥潭中使用。 （1 分 30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Plant the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement."] = "使用: 将占卜占卜器放置在大骨库地下室的中心。",
    ["Use: Plant the Glowing Seed in the Heart of Hive'Regal."] = "使用: 将发光种子种植在蜂巢君王的心脏中。",
    ["Use: Plant the Scourge banner at the Scarlet Crusade's forward base camp in the Western Plaguelands."] = "使用: 在西瘟疫之地的血色十字军前沿大本营插上天灾旗帜。",
    ["Use: Plant the banner near the entrance to Onyxia's Lair. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将旗帜放置在奥妮克希亚巢穴入口附近。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Plant the tree seedling in the fertile dirt mound."] = "使用：将树苗种植在肥沃的土堆中。",
    ["Use: Plant these seeds in the Stagnant Oasis fissure."] = "使用: 将这些种子种植在停滞绿洲的裂缝中。",
    ["Use: Plants Smokey's Special Compound at a Mark of Detonation. KABOOM!"] = "使用: 在爆炸标记处种植斯莫基的特殊化合物。轰隆隆！",
    ["Use: Plants a Thornling which attracts nearby enemies. (15 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 种植荆棘来吸引附近的敌人。 （15 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Points the wielder at the owner of the memories held within."] = "使用: 将持有者指向其中记忆的所有者。",
