    ["Use: Sobers you up a little."] = "使用: 让你清醒一点。",
    ["Use: Sprinkle the watering can onto the prepared soil. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：将喷壶洒在准备好的土壤上。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Stabs a devilsaur, inflicting a large dose of poison."] = "使用: 刺伤魔暴龙，造成大量中毒。",
    ["Use: Steals 75 to 125 life from target enemy."] = "使用: 窃取目标敌人 75 到 125 点生命。",
    ["Use: Stealth into the shadows, concealing you from enemies for 15 seconds. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 潜行到阴影中，让你隐藏起来不被敌人发现，持续 15 秒。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Stores the friendly target's soul. If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with 1100 health and 1700 mana."] = "使用：储存友方目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被储存期间死亡，将可以复活并恢复 1100 点生命值和 1700 点法力值。",
    ["Use: Stores the friendly target's soul. If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with 1600 health and 2200 mana."] = "使用：储存友方目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被储存期间死亡，将可以复活并恢复 1600 点生命值和 2200 点法力值。",
    ["Use: Stores the friendly target's soul. If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with 2200 health and 2800 mana."] = "使用：储存友方目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被储存期间死亡，将可以复活并恢复 2200 点生命值和 2800 点法力值。",
    ["Use: Stores the friendly target's soul. If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with 400 health and 700 mana."] = "使用：储存友方目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被储存期间死亡，将可以复活并恢复 400 点生命值和 700 点法力值。",
    ["Use: Stores the friendly target's soul. If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with 750 health and 1200 mana."] = "使用：储存友方目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被储存期间死亡，将可以复活并恢复 750 点生命值和 1200 点法力值。",
    ["Use: Stuns target for 3 sec. (15 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 击晕目标 3 秒。 （15 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon Myzrael from the Shards of Myzrael."] = "使用: 从密斯莱尔碎片中召唤密斯莱尔。",
    ["Use: Summon Wuti's Water Totem to heal the heat stricken tuskarr. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤乌提的水图腾来治愈中暑的海象人。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon a Sepulcher Abomination and bind it to your will for 5 min. May only be used in The Sepulcher."] = "使用: 召唤一个坟墓憎恶，并将其束缚在你的意志上，持续 5 分钟。只能在坟墓中使用。",
    ["Use: Summon a Sniffotron MK IV to locate Beezil Linkspanner."] = "使用：召唤嗅探器四型来定位比兹尔·链轮。",
    ["Use: Summon a Xorothian Dreadsteed within an empowered Circle of Dark Summoning. (20 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在强化的黑暗召唤之环中召唤一匹克索罗斯恐惧战马。 （20 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon a miniature mana elemental to aid you in combat for 10 minutes. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤一个微型法力元素来帮助你战斗，持续 10 分钟。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon a ring of light on a specific location that lasts for 3 min. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在特定位置召唤一个持续3分钟的光环。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon a screecher spirit from the corpse of a vale screecher. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 从山谷尖叫者的尸体中召唤尖叫者灵魂。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon an Empowered Kezan's Premium Refrigerator to heal the heat-stricken tuskarr. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤一台强化科赞的高级冰箱来治愈中暑的海象人。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon and control your Remote Controlled Gnome Car. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤并控制你的遥控侏儒车。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon and control your Remote Controlled Goblin Car. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤并控制你的遥控妖精车。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summon the Tremormatic MK I."] = "使用：召唤震颤仪一型。",
