    ["Use: Summon the spirits of the dead at haunted locations."] = "使用: 在闹鬼的地方召唤死者的灵魂。",
    ["Use: Summon three baby Spiderlings to protect you for 10 min. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤三只小蜘蛛来保护你，持续 10 分钟。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons Aquementas. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤阿奎门塔斯。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons Edana Hatetalon."] = "使用: 召唤艾达娜·哈泰隆。",
    ["Use: Summons a Felhound Tracker. Read the manual!"] = "使用: 召唤一条地狱犬追踪者。阅读手册！",
    ["Use: Summons a Hammer of Expertise. (3 Hr Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤一把专精之锤。 （3 小时冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons a Mana Spring Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster for 24 sec that restores 27 mana every 2 seconds to group members within 30 yards. (3 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在施法者脚下召唤一个具有 5 点生命值的法力泉图腾，持续 24 秒，每 2 秒为 30 码内的小队成员恢复 27 点法力。 （3 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons a Skeleton that will protect you for 1 min. (15 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤一个骷髅来保护你 1 分钟。 （15 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons a Skeleton that will protect you for 1 min. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤一个骷髅来保护你 1 分钟。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons a Spirit Calling Totem nearby, which lasts for 2 min. The totem will free the spirit of a lesser nether drake if it dies within 15 yards of the totem. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：在附近召唤一个召唤灵魂图腾，持续2分钟。如果小虚空龙在图腾周围 15 码内死亡，图腾将释放它的灵魂。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons a Timberling to protect you for 20 min."] = "使用: 召唤一只林木精灵来保护你，持续 20 分钟。",
    ["Use: Summons a cannon that will fire at enemies in front of it that are attacking you. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤一门大炮，向前方攻击你的敌人开火。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons a guardian felhunter that will protect you for 1 hour."] = "使用: 召唤一名守护地狱猎手来保护你 1 小时。",
    ["Use: Summons a mechanical Greench that will protect you for 10 min. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：召唤一个机械格林奇保护你，持续 10分钟。（10分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Summons a mechanical yeti that will protect you for 10 min. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：召唤一个机械雪人保护你，持续 10分钟。（10分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Summons a tracking hound that will protect you for 10 min. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：召唤一只追踪猎犬保护你，持续 10分钟。（10分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Summons an Explosive Sheep which will charge at a nearby enemy and explode for 135 to 165 damage. Lasts for 3 min or until it explodes."] = "使用: 召唤一只爆炸羊，它会冲向附近的敌人并爆炸，造成 135 到 165 点伤害。持续 3 分钟或直至爆炸。",
    ["Use: Summons an Eye of Kilrogg and binds your vision to it. The eye moves quickly but is very fragile. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 召唤基尔罗格之眼并将你的视野与它绑定。眼睛转动很快，但非常脆弱。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Summons ancient spirits in the Irontree Woods."] = "使用: 召唤铁树森林中的远古灵魂。",
