    ["Use: Teleports the caster to Mor'shan Base Camp in the Barrens. (1 Hr Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将施法者传送至贫瘠之地的莫山大本营。 （1 小时冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Teleports the caster to Silverwing Grove in Ashenvale. (1 Hr Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将施法者传送到灰谷的银翼丛林。 （1 小时冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Teleports the user to Wobble Hollow. (3 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将用户传送至摇摆山谷。 （3 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Teleports the user to the top of Northshire Falls. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将用户传送至北郡瀑布顶部。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Tenderize a humanoid or beast corpse. (10 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 软化人形生物或野兽尸体。 （10 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Test the crystal on the prisoner. (15 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 在囚犯身上测试水晶。 （15 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Test the invention."] = "使用：测试本发明。",
    ["Use: Test this sample for quality. Requires Field Testing Kit."] = "用途：测试该样品的质量。需要现场测试套件。",
    ["Use: Tests the Janky Mind Control Helmet on an Elder Mistvale Gorilla. Only usable at low health."] = "使用：在年长的迷雾谷大猩猩身上测试简陋的精神控制头盔。只能在目标生命值较低时使用。",
    ["Use: The Ankh of Life will bring the person attuned to it back to life."] = "使用：生命十字章将使与其协调的人起死回生。",
    ["Use: The Symbol of Life will bring the person attuned to it back to life."] = "使用：生命象征将使与之协调的人复活。",
    ["Use: The cover depicts the crystal seas of Nazjatar. Teaches Conjure Water (Rank 7)"] = "使用: 封面描绘了纳沙塔尔的水晶海洋。教授召唤水（等级 7）",
    ["Use: The devices charges over time using your life force and then directs a burst of energy at your opponent. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：这些装置会随着时间的推移使用你的生命力进行充电，然后将能量爆发向你的对手。 （5 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: The dynamite for Non-Engineers that nearly always gets to the target! Inflicts 51 to 69 Fire damage in a 5 yard radius."] = "使用：非工程师的炸药，几乎总能到达目标！在 5 码半径内造成 51 到 69 点火焰伤害。",
    ["Use: The sword must be reforged before it can be used. Reforging the sword requires 4 Steel Bars, 4 Strong Flux , 2 Elemental Fire and 2 Heavy Grinding Stones."] = "使用：剑必须经过重铸才能使用。重铸剑需要 4 根钢棒、4 颗强力助熔剂、2 颗元素之火和 2 颗重磨石。",
    ["Use: These boots significantly increase your run speed for 20 sec. WARNING: Their power supply and gyros do not always function as intended. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 这些靴子可以显着提高你的奔跑速度，持续 20 秒。警告：它们的电源和陀螺仪并不总是按预期工作。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: These dangerous looking boots significantly increase your run speed for 20 sec. They are prone to explode however, so use with caution. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：这双看起来很危险的靴子会显著提高你的奔跑速度，持续 20 秒。不过它们容易爆炸，请谨慎使用。（5分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: This Sealed Title grants you \"Of Epoch\" Title. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：此密封称号授予你纪元之称号。（1分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: This container needs to be filled with water from the fissure beneath the Venture Co. settlement in Stonetalon Mountains."] = "使用：这个容器需要从石爪山脉风险投资公司定居点下方的裂缝中注入水。",
    ["Use: This container needs to be filled with water from the fissure near Girna's dock in the Wetlands."] = "使用：这个容器需要从湿地吉纳码头附近的裂缝中注入水。",
    ["Use: This container needs to be filled with water from the watering hole near Brine's hut in the Barrens."] = "使用：这个容器需要从贫瘠之地布赖恩小屋附近的水坑里装满水。",
    ["Use: This container needs to be filled with water from the well in Raven Hill."] = "使用：这个容器需要装满来自乌鸦岭水井的水。",
