    ["Use: This container should be filled with water from the corrupt moon well in Jaedenar."] = "使用：这个容器应该装满来自加德纳尔腐化月井的水。",
    ["Use: This container should be filled with water from the first tide pool in Azshara."] = "使用：这个容器应该装满来自艾萨拉第一个潮汐池的水。",
