    ["Use: This container should be filled with water from the third tide pool in Azshara."] = "使用：这个容器应该装满来自艾萨拉第三个潮汐池的水。",
    ["Use: This dig rat is still struggling, why don't you let it go? (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：这只挖土鼠还在挣扎，你为什么不放开它呢？ （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Throw a Tel'Abim Banana at a Groddoc Thunderer. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将特尔阿比姆香蕉扔向格罗多克雷霆者。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Throw a blue smoke flare at a specific location that lasts for 5 min."] = "使用：向指定位置投掷一枚蓝色烟幕弹，持续 5分钟。",
    ["Use: Throw a green smoke flare at a specific location that lasts for 5 min."] = "使用：向指定位置投掷一枚绿色烟幕弹，持续 5分钟。",
    ["Use: Throw me! (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：把我扔出去！（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Throw near a patron of the Grim Guzzler (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：扔到黑铁酒吧的顾客附近。（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Throw rock to a friendly target. If they have free room in their pack they will catch it! (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：将石块扔给友方目标。如果对方背包有空位，就会接住它！（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Throw the Flying Machine to a friendly player. If they have free room in their pack they will catch it!"] = "使用: 将飞行器扔给友方玩家。如果他们的背包中有空闲空间，他们就会抓住它！",
    ["Use: Throw the axe at a nearby target dummy. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将斧头扔向附近的目标假人。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Throw the axe at a nearby target dummy. (4 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将斧头扔向附近的目标假人。 （4 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Throw the ball to a friendly player. If they have free room in their pack they will catch it! (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：将球扔给友方目标。如果对方背包有空位，就会接住它！（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: To be used at the makeshift helipad in Azshara. It will summon Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter to pick up the tablet rubbings."] = "使用：在艾萨拉的临时直升机停机坪使用。它将召唤飞行员希格斯引火者来拾取平板拓片。",
    ["Use: Toss the Incendia Powder into the sacred fire of life."] = "使用: 将炽热粉末扔进神圣的生命之火中。",
    ["Use: Toss your luck! (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 祝你好运！ （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transfers the Balefire curse from you to an enemy target. Only usable in the Blasted Lands. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：将你身上的灾火诅咒转移给一个敌方目标。只能在诅咒之地使用。（10秒冷却）",
    ["Use: Transform into a Moonstalker and become invisible for 5 min. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 变身为月行者并隐形 5 分钟。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms 4 Deeprock Salt into 2 Refined Deeprock Salt. (7 Days Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将 4 个深岩盐转化为 2 个精炼深岩盐。 （7 天冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms 4 Felcloth into 2 Mooncloth without the aid of a moonwell. (7 Days Cooldown)"] = "使用: 无需月亮井的帮助即可将 4 块恶魔布转化为 2 块月布。 （7 天冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms 5 Thorium Bars and an Arcane Crystal into 2 Arcanite Bars. (7 Days Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将 5 块瑟银锭和一块奥术水晶转化为 2 块奥金块。 （7 天冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms Zala'thria into a sheep, forcing her to wander around for up to 20 sec. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly. Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将扎拉瑟莉亚变成一只羊，迫使她四处游荡长达 20 秒。徘徊时，羊无法攻击或施法，但会很快再生。任何伤害都会将目标变回正常形态。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms caster to look like a member of the opposing faction. (30 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将施法者变成敌对派系的成员。 （30 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms the caster to the appearance of a Revantusk Troll. (4 Hr Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将施法者转变为恶牙巨魔的外观。 （4 小时冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms the target into a Leper Gnome, reducing its melee and spell damage by 40 and its movement rate by 20% for 12 sec."] = "使用: 将目标转变为麻风侏儒，使其近战伤害和法术伤害降低 40 点，移动速度降低 20%，持续 12 秒。",
    ["Use: Transforms you into a Furbolg for 3 min. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将你变成熊怪，持续 3 分钟。 （1 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Transforms your mount into something more festive. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：将你的坐骑变得更有节日气氛。（1分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Turn 10 crystallized life into an eternal life."] = "使用: 将10个生命结晶转化为永恒生命。",
    ["Use: Turn a greater astral essence into three lesser ones."] = "使用：将一个强效星界精华转化为三个次级精华。",
    ["Use: Turn a greater eternal essence into three lesser ones."] = "使用：将一个强效不灭精华转化为三个次级精华。",
    ["Use: Turn a greater magic essence into three lesser ones."] = "使用：将一个强效魔法精华转化为三个次级精华。",
    ["Use: Turn a greater mystic essence into three lesser ones."] = "使用：将一个强效秘法精华转化为三个次级精华。",
    ["Use: Turn a greater nether essence into three lesser ones."] = "使用：将一个强效虚空精华转化为三个次级精华。",
    ["Use: Turn a greater planar essence into three lesser ones."] = "使用: 将一个高等位面精华变成三个较小位面精华。",
