    ["Use: Turn an eternal fire into 10 crystallized fire."] = "使用: 将永恒之火转化为10个结晶之火。",
    ["Use: Turn an eternal shadow into 10 crystallized shadow."] = "使用: 将一个永恒之影变成10个结晶之影。",
    ["Use: Turn ten Motes of Flame into a Molten Lure."] = "使用: 将十颗火焰微粒变成熔岩诱饵。",
    ["Use: Turn three lesser astral essences into a greater one."] = "使用：将三个次级星界精华转化为一个强效精华。",
    ["Use: Turn three lesser eternal essences into a greater one."] = "使用：将三个次级不灭精华转化为一个强效精华。",
    ["Use: Turn three lesser magic essences into a greater one."] = "使用：将三个次级魔法精华转化为一个强效精华。",
    ["Use: Turn three lesser mystic essences into a greater one."] = "使用：将三个次级秘法精华转化为一个强效精华。",
    ["Use: Turn three lesser nether essences into a greater one."] = "使用：将三个次级虚空精华转化为一个强效精华。",
    ["Use: Turn three lesser planar essences into a greater one."] = "使用: 将三个较小的位面精华变成一个较大的位面精华。",
    ["Use: Unfolds into a Field Repair Bot that can repair damaged items and purchase unwanted goods. After 10 minutes its internal motor fails."] = "使用：展开为现场维修机器人，可以修复损坏的物品并购买不需要的物品。 10 分钟后，其内部电机出现故障。",
    ["Use: Unleash Sul on yourself and Thraze on your enemy.nnSul absorbs 750 damage, when the shield breaks it releases a burst of healing on your party, lasts 5 min.nnThraze lowers your target's Strength by 15 and deals 90 to 210 Shadow damage with an additional 416 Shadow damage over 50 sec. (5 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：对自己释放苏尔，对敌人释放萨雷兹。苏尔吸收 750 点伤害，护盾破裂时会为你的小队释放一次治疗爆发，持续 5 分钟。萨雷兹使目标力量降低 15 点，造成 90 到 210 点暗影伤害，并在 50 秒内额外造成 416 点暗影伤害。（5分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: Unleash a volley of frostbolts at targets within 25 yards in front of you, dealing 245 damage and slowing them by 30% for 4 sec. (4 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 对前方 25 码内的目标发射一连串冰箭，造成 245 点伤害并使其减速 30%，持续 4 秒。 （4 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Unleash the fury of Foss' friends. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 释放福斯朋友的愤怒。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
