    ["Use: Used on plagued water elementals in Eastern Plaguelands. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：用于东瘟疫之地受瘟疫的水元素。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Used to capture a rabid thistle bear."] = "使用：用于捕捉患有狂犬病的蓟熊。",
    ["Use: Used to create rubbings of the runes in the Ruins of Eldarath."] = "使用: 用于制作埃达拉斯废墟中的符文拓片。",
    ["Use: Wakes up a targeted sleeping peon. (5 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 唤醒目标沉睡的苦工。 （5 秒冷却时间）",
