    ["Use: When applied to a melee weapon it gives a 15% chance of casting Shadowbolt III at the opponent when it hits. Lasts 30 minutes. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：涂在近战武器上之后，击中时有 15% 的几率对敌人施放暗影箭三级。持续 30 分钟。（1秒冷却）",
    ["Use: When applied to your fishing pole, increases Fishing by 100 for 5 minutes."] = "使用：涂在你的鱼竿上之后，钓鱼技能提高 100 点，持续 5分钟。",
    ["Use: When applied to your fishing pole, increases Fishing by 25 for 10 min."] = "使用：涂在你的鱼竿上之后，钓鱼技能提高 25 点，持续 10分钟。",
    ["Use: When applied to your fishing pole, increases Fishing by 50 for 10 min."] = "使用：涂在你的鱼竿上之后，钓鱼技能提高 50 点，持续 10分钟。",
    ["Use: When applied to your fishing pole, increases Fishing by 50 for 10 minutes."] = "使用：涂在你的鱼竿上之后，钓鱼技能提高 50 点，持续 10分钟。",
    ["Use: When applied to your fishing pole, increases Fishing by 75 and you have a chance to obtain an extra item when fishing in lava or magma for 10 min. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 涂抹在钓鱼竿上时，钓鱼能力提高 75 点，并且在熔岩或岩浆中钓鱼 10 分钟时有机会获得额外物品。 （10 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: When applied to your fishing pole, increases Fishing by 75 for 10 minutes."] = "使用：涂在你的鱼竿上之后，钓鱼技能提高 75 点，持续 10分钟。",
    ["Use: While applied to target weapon it increases spell damage by up to 16. Lasts for 1 hour. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 当应用于目标武器时，它会增加法术伤害最多 16 点。持续 1 小时。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: While applied to target weapon it increases spell damage by up to 8. Lasts for 1 hour. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 当应用于目标武器时，它会增加法术伤害最多 8 点。持续 1 小时。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: While applied to target weapon it restores 12 mana to the caster every 5 seconds and increases the effect of healing spells by up to 25. Lasts for 30 minutes. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 当应用于目标武器时，它每 5 秒为施法者恢复 12 点法力，并使治疗法术的效果最多提高 25 点。持续 30 分钟。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: While applied to target weapon it restores 4 mana to the caster every 5 seconds. Lasts for 30 minutes. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 当应用于目标武器时，它每 5 秒为施法者恢复 4 点法力。持续30分钟。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: While applied to target weapon it restores 8 mana to the caster every 5 seconds. Lasts for 30 minutes. (1 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 当应用于目标武器时，它每 5 秒为施法者恢复 8 点法力。持续30分钟。 （1 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Will release Yenniku from his imprisonment (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：将延尼库从监禁中释放（2分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Wish a friend some Season's Greetings!"] = "使用: 向朋友致以节日问候！",
    ["Use: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 50 damage over 30 sec. (1 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：使目标受伤流血，在 30秒 内造成 50 点伤害。（1分钟冷却）",
    ["Use: You really shouldn't drink this."] = "使用：你真的不应该喝这个。",
    ["Use: You turn to stone, protecting you from all physical attacks and spells for 1 min, but during that time you cannot attack, move or cast spells. You can only have the effect of one flask at a time."] = "使用：你变成石头，保护你免受所有物理攻击和法术攻击，持续 1 分钟，但在此期间你无法攻击、移动或施法。您一次只能获得一个药剂的效果。",
    ["Use: Your attack power is increased by 60. Every second this bonus is reduced by 3. Lasts 20 seconds. (15 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用：你的攻击强度增加60点。每秒该加值减少3点。持续20秒。 （15 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Your pet's next attack is guaranteed to critically strike if that attack is capable of striking critically. (2 Min Cooldown)"] = "使用: 如果你的宠物的下一次攻击能够造成暴击，那么它的下一次攻击就一定会造成暴击。 （2 分钟冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Your size is increased and your Strength goes up by 8 to match your new size. Lasts 2 min. Battle Elixir."] = "使用：你的体型增大，力量提高 8 点以匹配新的体型。持续 2分钟。战斗药剂。",
    ["Use: Zap a Crew Member awake."] = "使用: 唤醒一名船员。",
    ["Use: Zap a Feralas giant into a more manageable form. (30 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用: 将菲拉斯巨人变成更容易控制的形态。 （30 秒冷却时间）",
    ["Use: Zaps pests dead."] = "使用：杀死害虫。",
  }
end
